        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background-color:#0b2a2a;background-image:radial-gradient(90cqw 55cqw at 12% -8%,color-mix(in srgb,#0f766e 42%,transparent),transparent),repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0,transparent 5.6cqw,color-mix(in srgb,#f4c95d 7%,transparent) 5.6cqw,color-mix(in srgb,#f4c95d 7%,transparent) 5.72cqw);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ecfdf9'><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:3cqw;font:800 1.4cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f4c95d'>The Studio · How it gets done</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:5cqw;font:500 6.6cqw/1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Times New Roman,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap'>Plans</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;width:41.42cqw;top:12.6cqw;font:italic 400 2cqw/1.35 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Times New Roman,serif;color:#bfeee3'>How it gets done. Each tile is a plan: an aim, its phases, and the steps in them.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:21.25cqw;top:30.31cqw;width:60.63cqw;height:47.5cqw;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:2cqw;background:color-mix(in srgb,#f4c95d 6%,#0b2a2a);border:.28cqw solid color-mix(in srgb,#f4c95d 26%,#0b2a2a)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:45.02cqw;top:21.71cqw;height:8.6cqw;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:.35cqw'><i style='display:block;width:1.5cqw;height:7.7cqw;background:#f4c95d;border-radius:.25cqw .25cqw 0 0;box-shadow:inset -.2cqw 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,.28)'></i><i style='display:block;width:1.95cqw;height:9.1cqw;background:#134e4a;border-radius:.25cqw .25cqw 0 0;box-shadow:inset -.2cqw 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,.28)'></i><i style='display:block;width:2.4cqw;height:6.3cqw;background:#14b8a6;border-radius:.25cqw .25cqw 0 0;box-shadow: